bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    lint_forced_jit_clean_target_unwrap_none_2026-11-27, 0, "Registered 2026-11-27 by p3sweep3 wave-8 lane, exposed while closing seed_jit_coverage_self_hosted_compiler_2026-08-21: with the lint entry closure truly on the JIT lane, linting a warning-free target on the forced-JIT lane crashes fail-closed with error: called unwrap on None, rc 127 (~18s for any clean .spl). Masked pre-fix because every forced-JIT lint de-JITted first; the default lint lane is interpreter-by-design (reason=lint-jit-parity-unproven) so no default-lane user is affected. Suspected: lint clean-path Option handling under JIT (e.g. linter.last_resolved_config.unwrap() in src/compiler/90.tools/lint/_LintMain/entry_and_fixes.spl) - verify before fixing. Full repro: build/p3cache/jitcov/CLOSE-NOTE.md. The document remains the authority for diagnosis and acceptance."
    lint_forced_jit_clean_target_unwrap_none_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-28 p3sweep8: row re-closed - wave-13 fix merged and verified. Recap: the doc's named suspect (linter.last_resolved_config.unwrap) was cleared - both sites are guarded and the Option is Some on both lanes; the actual crash site was entry_and_fixes.spl:345 config.profile.? and config.profile.unwrap() == Critical - condition-position .? rewrites to the rt_is_present bool predicate but value-position .? keeps the T? word whose absent arm is the nil sentinel 3 (non-zero), and the MIR short-circuit branch tested the raw word != 0, so an absent .? read truthy and the RHS ran. Fix (operators.rs:318): value-position and/or runs the existing coerce_exists_value_to_bool_in_place over the lowered tree (mirroring the pre-existing not x.? fix); recursion scoped to and/or/not/if/block shapes so a .? used as a value deeper inside an operand keeps payload form. Spec seed_jit_value_position_dotq_short_circuit RED 2/2 to GREEN 2/2 both lanes. Residual: bare-optional (non-.?) and/or operands still branch on the raw word (mir/lower, follow-up); pure-Simple MIR parity not exercised (seed lane). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/seed_jit_value_position_dotq_short_circuit_spec.spl prevention=src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/hir/lower/expr/operators.rs"

