    lint_forced_jit_clean_target_unwrap_none_2026-11-27, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep6-20261128 (genuine HIR bug: value-position x.? and/or short-circuit read the nil sentinel 3 as truthy under JIT - coerce_exists_value_to_bool_in_place in hir/lower/expr/operators.rs; fixes the lint unwrap crash + 16 latent miscompiles); shard row re-closed 2026-11-28 after a merge clobbered the closure", doc/08_tracking/bug/lint_forced_jit_clean_target_unwrap_none_2026-11-27.md, 1, doc/08_tracking/bug/lint_forced_jit_clean_target_unwrap_none_2026-11-27.md, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-28, true
